er-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-121086/selection/ma-v1/778e9df1b5b475027758636daada05d880fadb4241a813ac7715ef8a77e8bd02/bab4acf5ca3a66ed4f11bbcf7574627e6848417923ee89f9393917451c190309" :answer-field/choices ["q-121086/selection/ma-v1/778e9df1b5b475027758636daada05d880fadb4241a813ac7715ef8a77e8bd02/e4d5cbdd1dc7cc0dd0fdf2a9056c717b9f60123484c35fc7a65c937abab9db2f" "q-121086/selection/ma-v1/778e9df1b5b475027758636daada05d880fadb4241a813ac7715ef8a77e8bd02/46070df805b4653a5d877039a93fbcfb0cf7186aafc46672fa7e330153961054" "q-121086/selection/ma-v1/778e9df1b5b475027758636daada05d880fadb4241a813ac7715ef8a77e8bd02/bab4acf5ca3a66ed4f11bbcf7574627e6848417923ee89f9393917451c190309" "q-121086/selection/ma-v1/778e9df1b5b475027758636daada05d880fadb4241a813ac7715ef8a77e8bd02/6ec7f55390e84a805c2f4b28c93f893967d5f7a64eeb901750d34dda29cf16f4" "q-121086/selection/ma-v1/778e9df1b5b475027758636daada05d880fadb4241a813ac7715ef8a77e8bd02/c8a570a7a45299d6bca7534749498af91d95f2281bdd8454030e707cf44ee838"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-121086"] :question/problem "Consider the expression $f(x,y)=-2xy.$ What are the missing entries in the following sign table of $f(x,y)?$\n\n| $y>0$ |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $y<0$ |  |  |\n|  | $x<0$ | $x>0$ |" :question/worked-solution "Notice that $f(x,y)$ equals zero when $x=0$ and $y=0.$ These lines divide the $xy$-plane into four regions, as shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14038247/assets/c35c98904d2a0d0d6d49c582cd9f9dba9d96e91ae0da5deb2d329f38f77532e3.png)\n\nTo determine the sign of $f(x,y)$ in each region, we pick four test points, one for each region.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14038247/assets/9340582eaad37c4ce1e0c8cbcdce48faec1e36c3c05adbedd61aa2de7168fd2f.png)\n\nNext, we calculate the sign of $f(x,y)$ in each region using a sign table:\n\n|  | Test point | $-2x$ | $y$ | $f(x,y)$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Top-Left | $(-1,1)$ | $+$ | $+$ | $+$ |\n| Top-Right | $(1,1)$ | $-$ | $+$ | $-$ |\n| Bottom-Left | $(-1,-1)$ | $+$ | $-$ | $-$ |\n| Bottom-Right | $(1,-1)$ | $-$ | $-$ | $+$ |\n\n \nUsing the *last* column of the table above, we get the following picture:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14038247/assets/fa7402608c175237bfed11ddf032d867a0685e2ad5cf31f848809f796b705780.png)\n\nFinally, we fill in the required sign table.\n\n| $y>0$ | $+$ | $-$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $y<0$ | $-$ | $+$ |\n|  | $x<0$ | $x>0$ |" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-121086/selection/ma-v1/778e9df1b5b475027758636daada05d880fadb4241a813ac7715ef8a77e8bd02"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-121252/selection/fee66ab7e1909bff2bf51c8e142adab15b88bc58e721b9656f443e155725d23d" :answer/id #uuid "3f524f2e-c6d2-577e-b04d-69e261f5737c" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14038247/assets/29cf79e3f216a3b33656473fd98bd04252e2abd6304fdd575ee56cd33e1f4c3d.png" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-121252/selection/8861299c65d4904cd37be75484ed33095f31a94097b57c735ccc51a3788f28c7" :answer/id #uuid "03fcc353-76f1-5f88-8100-9387e9cf3c1f" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14038247/assets/058a4ec5eba7a1ada3fc5b89ada73819672a19f88fbf4450d1b2c04a4b0db498.png" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-121252/selection/723fe72955dc08163472a6cb719aeca3e590eb162bda88ce0b0ad0152abc2fe3" :answer/id #uuid "15b81cd2-f3a9-53fe-88b6-0e050a5f3671" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14038247/assets/9ca3a2fd93541dd1865f95beb53cddeb3ff1e7759e1534ae547c4b943931d24e.png" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-121252/selec